OL,3,CHigh Court phone-hacking verdict is
OL,4,Chuge personal blow to Prince Harry
OL,6,FPrince Harry is currently on stage in
OL,7,FLondon at a conference about the
OL,8,Flegacy of the Invictus Games he
OL,9,Ffounded in 2014.
OL,11,FThere was no outward sign of
OL,12,Fdisappointment on his face as he stood
OL,13,Fup to speak to the room of delegates
OL,14,Fin St James Square.
OL,16,FHe spoke about his love for the
OL,17,FInvictus movement for wounded, injured
OL,18,Fand sick military personnel. However,
OL,19,Fhe did not mention the High Court
OL,20,Flibel case, which he had dramatically
OL,21,Flost moments before.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/4
