OL,3,CHigh Court phone-hacking verdict is
OL,4,Chuge personal blow to Prince Harry
OL,6,F'He lost convincingly' - Expert
OL,7,Freaction to Prince Harry's privacy
OL,8,Fcase defeat to Mail publisher
OL,10,FHis team had been hoping for at least
OL,11,Fone or two wins in the cases the Duke
OL,12,Fof Sussex had brought before the
OL,13,Fcourt, claiming that stories had been
OL,14,Fobtained by unlawful information
OL,15,Fgathering.
OL,17,FIn the end, the judge, Mr Justice
OL,18,FNicklin, dismissed all the claims made
OL,19,Fagainst the Daily Mail publisher by
OL,20,Fall six claimants.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/4
