OL,3,CHigh Court phone-hacking verdict is
OL,4,Chuge personal blow to Prince Harry
OL,6,FHaving won his previous two cases
OL,7,Fagainst the publishers of the Sun and
OL,8,FNews of the World, and the publishers
OL,9,Fof the Mirror titles, it will be a
OL,10,Fhuge personal blow to the Prince.
OL,12,FThe decision from the High Court came
OL,13,Fon the first day of Harry's five-day
OL,14,Fvisit to the UK, which had already
OL,15,Fsuffered a rocky start with public
OL,16,Farguments over his accommodation at
OL,17,FBuckingham Palace and the lack of
OL,18,Fpublicly funded security for him and
OL,19,Fhis family when in the country.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/4
